    'What does confidence mean in schema mapping?': '在模式映射中置信度是什么意思？',
    'Confidence is the semantic match score between source and target field names. High confidence means the mapping is highly reliable.': '置信度是源字段与目标字段名称的语义匹配评分。高置信度表示映射非常可靠。',
